WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.288 --> 00:00:02.157
- (Laughs) Have I ever done any modeling?

00:00:02.157 --> 00:00:04.574
(laughs) No.

00:00:05.966 --> 00:00:08.374
I'm a little nervous
about this photo shoot.

00:00:08.374 --> 00:00:11.838
I don't do anything really,
like, focused on myself,

00:00:11.838 --> 00:00:15.564
so the fact that it's going
to be about me is a little...

00:00:15.564 --> 00:00:16.624
- I'm excited.

00:00:16.624 --> 00:00:18.602
I get to pose with an animal.

00:00:18.602 --> 00:00:20.859
- I don't know how I'm
about to take off my clothes

00:00:20.859 --> 00:00:24.478
for the camera right now, but here we go.

00:00:24.478 --> 00:00:29.257
- I expect this experience
to be a little uncomfortable.

00:00:29.257 --> 00:00:32.798
Having somebody do your
hair and makeup, and then

00:00:32.798 --> 00:00:34.971
I have no idea, just fashion-wise,

00:00:34.971 --> 00:00:36.614
what I'm going to look like.

00:00:36.614 --> 00:00:37.637
- I'm excited.

00:00:37.637 --> 00:00:38.483
I'm excited.

00:00:38.483 --> 00:00:43.127
I am an Instagram model
in my head, so I'm ready.

00:00:43.127 --> 00:00:44.908
And, you know, I love me some Beyonce,

00:00:44.908 --> 00:00:48.862
so I'm ready to tap into that part of me.

00:00:48.862 --> 00:00:50.953
- My usual makeup routine
is done in my car.

00:00:50.953 --> 00:00:52.650
I drop my son off at school, and then

00:00:52.650 --> 00:00:55.236
I head to work and do my
makeup at the stoplights.

00:00:55.236 --> 00:00:56.889
- Since I got pregnant,
it's a lot more minimal

00:00:56.889 --> 00:00:58.258
than it used to be.

00:00:58.258 --> 00:01:01.057
I've been dealing with a
lot of pregnancy rosacea.

00:01:01.057 --> 00:01:03.418
Every time I put sunscreen on,
it makes my face freak out.

00:01:03.418 --> 00:01:07.851
Rashes on my face and just a
ton of weird stuff going on.

00:01:07.851 --> 00:01:09.593
- During the day, if I'm at home,

00:01:09.593 --> 00:01:14.253
splash water on my face,
and ponytail or whatever up.

00:01:14.253 --> 00:01:15.086
Oh, God.

00:01:15.086 --> 00:01:17.300
Every time a celebrity has
a baby and I look at them

00:01:17.300 --> 00:01:18.839
afterwards, I'm like, "No.

00:01:18.839 --> 00:01:20.756
"Mm-mm, no no no no no.

00:01:21.811 --> 00:01:23.054
"It's impossible."

00:01:23.054 --> 00:01:24.649
- I think if you happy, if
you're proud of your body,

00:01:24.649 --> 00:01:27.021
go ahead and show off, but
I do think they need to

00:01:27.021 --> 00:01:29.722
tell the truth and be
like, "Yeah, I had a chef.

00:01:29.722 --> 00:01:31.558
"I had a trainer.

00:01:31.558 --> 00:01:34.536
"I got some of this fat
sucked up out of my body."

00:01:34.536 --> 00:01:39.146
- It piles on a lot of added
pressure to get your body back

00:01:39.146 --> 00:01:41.979
as soon as you deliver, basically.

00:01:42.905 --> 00:01:45.572
(low-key music)

00:01:51.168 --> 00:01:53.918
- I'm really awkward with posing.

00:01:55.219 --> 00:01:58.768
I don't feel 100% comfortable
in front of a camera.

00:01:58.768 --> 00:02:00.489
I just want somebody to just pose me

00:02:00.489 --> 00:02:02.989
in every photo, if they could.

00:02:05.174 --> 00:02:06.322
- [Offscreen Director] Use the arms.

00:02:06.322 --> 00:02:08.044
Put shoulders back at the same time.

00:02:08.044 --> 00:02:11.377
- (Laughing) Oh my God.

00:02:13.411 --> 00:02:15.629
- It hurts the hip a little. (laughing)

00:02:15.629 --> 00:02:17.296
I'm like, yes, hips!

00:02:19.515 --> 00:02:22.206
- [Offscreen Director] Relax your face.

00:02:22.206 --> 00:02:26.373
Yeah, and kind of look at me
without furrowing your brow.

00:02:27.364 --> 00:02:28.536
- Okay.

00:02:28.536 --> 00:02:31.790
You know, I knew that I'd be
able to pull something off

00:02:31.790 --> 00:02:34.379
with this, but I am glad,
after seeing the shots,

00:02:34.379 --> 00:02:36.045
that I really did, because
sometimes you envision

00:02:36.045 --> 00:02:38.345
in your mind what you think your picture's

00:02:38.345 --> 00:02:40.579
gonna look like, then you realize,

00:02:40.579 --> 00:02:42.188
"Oh no, I look like a piranha."

00:02:42.188 --> 00:02:43.827
It was nice to see the picture and see,

00:02:43.827 --> 00:02:44.945
"Oh yes." (snapping)

00:02:44.945 --> 00:02:46.855
"Yes, bitch, you are a smash."

00:02:46.855 --> 00:02:49.081
- It was absolutely amazing.

00:02:49.081 --> 00:02:51.616
The whole process was just so neat,

00:02:51.616 --> 00:02:53.356
getting my hair and makeup done,

00:02:53.356 --> 00:02:56.449
and just feeling completely pampered,

00:02:56.449 --> 00:02:59.556
and look at this little guy! (clucking)

00:02:59.556 --> 00:03:02.181
- I feel pretty good, surprisingly.

00:03:02.181 --> 00:03:03.507
Look at this hair, you guys.

00:03:03.507 --> 00:03:06.305
Look at this hair, what?

00:03:06.305 --> 00:03:07.994
- It wasn't what I expected.

00:03:07.994 --> 00:03:09.625
It was a unique experience.

00:03:09.625 --> 00:03:14.197
It takes a lot of work and
effort to look so effortless.

00:03:14.197 --> 00:03:18.999
- Getting my body into that
position was very unnatural,

00:03:18.999 --> 00:03:22.278
and it kind of made my
hips hurt a little bit.

00:03:22.278 --> 00:03:24.095
I have a lot more appreciation for models,

00:03:24.095 --> 00:03:25.553
I'll tell you that.

00:03:25.553 --> 00:03:29.409
- I feel like I was wearing
my pregnancy like a gown.

00:03:29.409 --> 00:03:31.964
- The first time I looked
at myself afterwards,

00:03:31.964 --> 00:03:35.210
it really was one of those "damn" moments.

00:03:35.210 --> 00:03:37.842
It was a pretty nice
feeling, like, that's me.

00:03:37.842 --> 00:03:41.421
- Looking at the photos
after they were taken

00:03:41.421 --> 00:03:45.212
and seeing that sexiness come through was

00:03:45.212 --> 00:03:49.975
very interesting for me because
I don't see myself as sexy.

00:03:49.975 --> 00:03:52.964
That's something that, you know,
you do when you're younger,

00:03:52.964 --> 00:03:55.632
and you don't have kids,
and you're not married,

00:03:55.632 --> 00:03:57.792
and it's like, once you
have kids, you're a mom.

00:03:57.792 --> 00:04:01.730
It was kind of cool to
let that side out and

00:04:01.730 --> 00:04:05.897
try to emulate a very sexy woman
who happens to be a mother.

